# ── Added when this repository was first pushed ──────────────────────
# The Base44 export and the generated SQL contain REAL USER DATA —
# email addresses, age attestations, guardian consents and verification
# tokens. They are operational artefacts, not source, and must never be
# published. Regenerate them with migration/export-data.sh when needed.
migration/data/
migration/sql/

# Build output: a 54MB jar rebuilt by `mvn package` on every deploy.
server/target/
*.jar

# Deployment archives, likewise rebuilt rather than tracked.
*.zip

# The same build output as dist/, staged for upload. It was tracked by
# accident: a copy committed on 24 September was four days stale and carried
# none of the security fixes since, so anyone who uploaded it would have
# deployed a build predating them.
upload-dist/
